WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:17,150
I am having all sorts of problems with my true-rife machine since I didn't update.

00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:21,730
I have heard a ton of complaints online about true-rife since the company was sold,

00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:24,450
is there anything I can do?

00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:30,370
Well, yeah, if you have a trouble getting to your programs that I created for you, then

00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:34,890
I would suggest that you let us fix it.

00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:43,630
As far as people having troubles with true-rife, I would agree that there is a lot of scuttle

00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:49,890
but online now, I belong to a Facebook group, true-rife Facebook group, and some other

00:00:49,890 --> 00:01:01,010
rife Facebook groups, a lot of complaints online that we have been getting a lot of calls of

00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:03,570
people having issues with their true-rife machine.

00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:09,170
I would agree, and it's very unfortunate that the new owners are not supporting their

00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:10,170
machines.

00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:16,370
They don't do any support on anything, that's an F1117.

00:01:16,370 --> 00:01:25,210
So that is, again, we'll do everything we can to fix anything that you're having issues

00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:26,210
with.

00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:31,730
Usually, if it's a programming issue, let's say you do an update, and again, reminder, do not

00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:35,250
do any updates on your frequencies, on your true-rife.

00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:40,410
We used to have people update their true-rife frequencies on a very regular basis.

00:01:40,410 --> 00:01:44,530
Some people did it every month, some people did it every three months.

00:01:44,530 --> 00:01:53,650
The new owners are not doing any new programs.

00:01:53,650 --> 00:02:00,130
So there's no absolutely zero need to run an update.

00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:09,050
So do not run any updates on your true-rife program.

00:02:09,050 --> 00:02:12,570
But if you can't get to your programs, you have to trouble getting to your problems, just

00:02:12,570 --> 00:02:16,570
give us a call, let us do things and work on it.

00:02:16,570 --> 00:02:19,570
We'll be glad to help you with that.

00:02:19,570 --> 00:02:29,290
So I don't remember somebody that called us about getting to your programs or not, but if

00:02:29,290 --> 00:02:34,170
it's just having some issues with some quirks of the machine, we can maybe help you

00:02:34,170 --> 00:02:35,170
too.

00:02:35,170 --> 00:02:38,170
So let us know.

